From: Paul Levickij <plevickij57@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: display: msm: allow all MSM8x60 MDP MIDs

Sony's MSM8x60 display topology assigns eleven AXI master IDs on each of
the two MDP IOMMU ports to the common display read domain.  A single IOMMU
specifier describes one master ID, so an accurate board description needs
up to 22 entries rather than four.

Raise the MDP4 binding limit to cover that hardware topology.

Signed-off-by: Paul Levickij <plevickij57@gmail.com>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/msm/mdp4.yaml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/msm/mdp4.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/msm/mdp4.yaml
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/msm/mdp4.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/display/msm/mdp4.yaml
@@ -46,7 +46,7 @@ properties:
     maxItems: 1
 
   iommus:
-    maxItems: 4
+    maxItems: 22
 
   interconnects:
     minItems: 1
